This implementation provides:

Complete HSS-RNet Architecture — Mamba backbone, BiGRU refinement, TAAG, and classification layer

S-SSM Baseline — Structured state-space model with DPLR and HiPPO initialization

Full Preprocessing Pipeline — Leakage-resistant imputation, normalization, and sequence construction

Feature Extraction — All 11 statistical features described in the paper

Training Infrastructure — Weighted cross-entropy, early stopping, gradient clipping, and learning rate scheduling

Evaluation Utilities — Accuracy, precision, recall, F1, AUC, and ROC curves

Cross-Dataset Transfer — Zero-shot generalization evaluation

Configuration Management — YAML-based configs

Unit Tests — For all major components

GitHub-Ready Structure — README, setup.py, requirements.txt, and proper packaging
